              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe akalangulukilako abena Israeli, nakabili akabasala pakuti bakabe abantu abakwefye. Akalenga bakekale nakabili mu calo cabo, na benafyalo bakalaisa mukwikala nabo no kwikatana na ba ŋanda yakwa Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba mishobo iyingi bakabuula abena Israeli, no kubatwala ku calo ico Yawe abapeele, kulya kwine eko na bantu ba iyo mishobo bakalateekwa ubusha, no kulabombela aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli. Abaikete kale abena Israeli bunkole, ebo abena Israeli nabo bakekata bunkole, na bena Israeli nomba ebakalateeka abo bantu abalebacusha kale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
